# This dependency-free example needs no configuration and no API keys — the demo
# and tests run on the standard library alone. This file is a placeholder for the
# production version, which would persist durable state to Dataverse and wake
# sessions on a schedule:
#
# FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=<your-foundry-project-endpoint>
# DATAVERSE_URL=<your-dataverse-environment-url>
# AZURE_TENANT_ID=<your-tenant-id>
#
# Copy to .env and fill in real values only if you wire in live services.
# Never commit the .env file itself.
